{"seq":8,"slug":"domain-driven-design","title":"领域驱动设计","stage":"DONE","category":"cross-discipline","chapterCount":5,"docCount":20,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/domain-driven-design","rating":{"composite":4.07,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.75,"verdict":"consider","uScore":4}},"introMarkdown":"# 领域驱动设计 简介\n\n领域驱动设计（Domain-Driven Design，简称 DDD）是一套以业务领域为核心驱动力的软件设计方法论。它由 Eric Evans 在 2003 年提出，旨在解决复杂业务系统中技术实现与业务逻辑脱节的根本性问题。DDD 的核心理念是：软件的首要复杂性不在技术，而在业务本身——只有深刻理解领域知识，才能构建出真正有价值的系统。\n\n本手册面向有三年以上开发经验、正在或即将负责复杂业务系统设计的工程师。如果你曾在项目中遇到过\"需求理解偏差导致返工\"\"模块边界模糊引发耦合灾难\"\"代码越改越乱、业务逻辑散落各处\"等问题，DDD 提供的思维框架和实践模式将为你指明方向。\n\n第一章**战略设计**从全局视角审视系统的领域划分。统一语言让开发团队与业务专家建立共同的沟通基础；限界上下文为复杂领域划定清晰的模型边界；上下文映射描述多个限界上下文之间的协作关系；子域分类则帮助你识别核心域、支撑域和通用域，从而合理分配团队资源和技术投入。\n\n第二章**战术模式**深入单个限界上下文内部的建模技术。实体与值对象是领域模型的基本构建块；聚合与仓储确保数据的一致性边界和持久化抽象；领域事件捕捉业务中\"已发生的重要事实\"；领域服务封装不属于任何实体的跨对象业务逻辑。\n\n第三章**架构集成**探讨 DDD 如何与现代架构模式协同工作。六边形架构通过端口与适配器实现领域模型的技术无关性；CQRS 将读写模型分离以应对复杂查询需求；防腐层保护核心领域免受外部系统的污染；事件风暴作为协作建模方法，帮助团队快速发现领域事件和聚合边界。\n\n第四章**工程实现**将 DDD 理论落地到具体的技术栈。我们分别以 TypeScript 和 Java Spring 为例，展示领域模型在不同语言和框架中的实现方式；测试策略一节聚焦于如何验证领域逻辑的正确性；重构到 DDD 则提供了在遗留系统中渐进式引入 DDD 的实践路径。\n\n第五章**进阶主题**将视野扩展到更大规模和更复杂的场景。DDD 与微服务的天然契合点、事件溯源对领域建模的深远影响、大型系统中的 DDD 组织策略，以及常见陷阱与权衡——帮助你在真实项目中避免教条主义，务实地运用 DDD。\n\n建议的学习路径是：先通读第一章建立战略全局观，再深入第二章掌握战术建模能力，然后根据项目需要选读第三到五章的相关内容。DDD 的精髓不在于机械套用模式，而在于持续探索和深化对业务领域的理解。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"strategic-design","title":"战略设计","docCount":4,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/domain-driven-design/strategic-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bounded-context","title":"限界上下文","url":"/h/cross-discipline/domain-driven-design/strategic-design/bounded-context"},{"seq":2,"slug":"context-mapping","title":"上下文映射","url":"/h/cross-discipline/domain-driven-design/strategic-design/context-mapping"},{"seq":3,"slug":"subdomain-classification","title":"子域分类","url":"/h/cross-discipline/domain-driven-design/strategic-design/subdomain-classification"},{"seq":4,"slug":"ubiquitous-language","title":"统一语言","url":"/h/cross-discipline/domain-driven-design/strategic-design/ubiquitous-language"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"tactical-patterns","title":"战术模式","docCount":4,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/domain-driven-design/tactical-patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"entities-and-value-objects","title":"实体与值对象","url":"/h/cross-discipline/domain-driven-design/tactical-patterns/entities-and-value-objects"},{"seq":2,"slug":"aggregates-and-repositories","title":"聚合与仓储","url":"/h/cross-discipline/domain-driven-design/tactical-patterns/aggregates-and-repositories"},{"seq":3,"slug":"domain-events","title":"领域事件","url":"/h/cross-discipline/domain-driven-design/tactical-patterns/domain-events"},{"seq":4,"slug":"domain-services","title":"领域服务","url":"/h/cross-discipline/domain-driven-design/tactical-patterns/domain-services"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"architecture-integration","title":"架构集成","docCount":4,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/domain-driven-design/architecture-integration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hexagonal-architecture","title":"六边形架构","url":"/h/cross-discipline/domain-driven-design/architecture-integration/hexagonal-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cqrs-integration","title":"CQRS 集成","url":"/h/cross-discipline/domain-driven-design/architecture-integration/cqrs-integration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"anti-corruption-layer","title":"防腐层","url":"/h/cross-discipline/domain-driven-design/architecture-integration/anti-corruption-layer"},{"seq":4,"slug":"event-storming","title":"事件风暴","url":"/h/cross-discipline/domain-driven-design/architecture-integration/event-storming"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"implementation","title":"工程实现","docCount":4,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/domain-driven-design/implementation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ddd-in-typescript","title":"TypeScript 中的 DDD","url":"/h/cross-discipline/domain-driven-design/implementation/ddd-in-typescript"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ddd-in-java-spring","title":"Java Spring 中的 DDD","url":"/h/cross-discipline/domain-driven-design/implementation/ddd-in-java-spring"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ddd-testing-strategies","title":"DDD 测试策略","url":"/h/cross-discipline/domain-driven-design/implementation/ddd-testing-strategies"},{"seq":4,"slug":"refactoring-to-ddd","title":"重构到 DDD","url":"/h/cross-discipline/domain-driven-design/implementation/refactoring-to-ddd"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"advanced-topics","title":"进阶主题","docCount":4,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/domain-driven-design/advanced-topics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ddd-and-microservices","title":"DDD 与微服务","url":"/h/cross-discipline/domain-driven-design/advanced-topics/ddd-and-microservices"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ddd-and-event-sourcing","title":"DDD 与事件溯源","url":"/h/cross-discipline/domain-driven-design/advanced-topics/ddd-and-event-sourcing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"large-scale-ddd","title":"大规模 DDD","url":"/h/cross-discipline/domain-driven-design/advanced-topics/large-scale-ddd"},{"seq":4,"slug":"ddd-pitfalls-and-tradeoffs","title":"DDD 陷阱与权衡","url":"/h/cross-discipline/domain-driven-design/advanced-topics/ddd-pitfalls-and-tradeoffs"}]}]}